    ctaHeading: "Ready to Fill Your Classes and Grow Membership?",
    ctaText: "People searching for a gym or studio near them are choosing between you and three other options on the same map. Let's audit your current local visibility and build a fitness marketing strategy focused on trial sign-ups, membership growth, and retention — not just follower counts.",
