    ctaHeading: "Ready to Turn Nearby Searches Into Full Tables?",
    ctaText: "Whether you run a neighborhood cafe, a full-service restaurant, or a cloud kitchen, people nearby are searching for a place to eat right now — the question is whether they're finding you or the competitor with the better Maps listing. Let's audit your current visibility and build a restaurant marketing strategy focused on real footfall and repeat visits, locally and beyond.",
