    capabilities: [
      { icon: UtensilsCrossed, title: "Fine Dining & Multi-Cuisine Restaurants", desc: "Diners researching a fine dining or multi-cuisine restaurant check menus, ambience photos and reviews before ever calling for a table. We build out Google Business Profiles, high-quality visual content and review pipelines so your restaurant looks as good online as it does when guests walk in, turning browsers into reservations." },
      { icon: Coffee, title: "Cafes & Coffee Shops", desc: "Cafe traffic is driven by proximity and mood — someone typing 'cafe near me' decides in seconds based on photos and star ratings. We optimize local listings, run geo-targeted social campaigns and keep your review score active so you show up first for the walk-in crowd and the laptop-and-coffee regulars alike." },
      { icon: ChefHat, title: "Cloud Kitchens & Delivery-Only Brands", desc: "Cloud kitchens live or die on delivery-app visibility and off-platform brand search, since there's no physical storefront to draw people in. We build SEO and paid campaigns that drive direct orders alongside aggregator listings, plus social content that gives a delivery-only brand a real identity people remember and search for by name." },
      { icon: Wine, title: "Bars, Pubs & Lounges", desc: "Bars and lounges depend heavily on event nights, happy hours and word-of-mouth that starts on social media. We run social campaigns around events and offers, manage reputation across review platforms, and build local SEO so late-night searchers for 'bars near me' or 'live music tonight' land on you first." },
      { icon: Truck, title: "Food Trucks & Quick-Service Outlets", desc: "Food trucks and quick-service spots need to be discoverable wherever they park or open, often with shifting locations and tight margins. We build lightweight local SEO and social presence that update fast, so regular customers can always find today's location and new customers can find you through location-tagged search." },
      { icon: Building2, title: "Restaurant Chains & Franchises", desc: "Multi-location restaurant brands need consistent visibility across every outlet without every location managing marketing independently. We build scalable local SEO and listing management across locations, standardized social templates, and centralized reporting so head office sees performance city by city." },
      { icon: PartyPopper, title: "Banquet Halls & Event Catering", desc: "Banquet and catering decisions involve long research cycles, comparison shopping and word-of-mouth trust, unlike a quick meal decision. We build content and paid campaigns targeting people actively planning events, backed by portfolio-driven websites and review strategies that give serious bookers the confidence to inquire." },
      { icon: Leaf, title: "Vegan, Organic & Health-Focused Eateries", desc: "Health-conscious diners search with very specific terms — vegan, gluten-free, organic, sugar-free — and expect brands to speak that language clearly. We build SEO content and social messaging around those specific dietary searches so health-focused eateries capture a highly loyal, repeat-visiting audience." },
      { icon: Pizza, title: "Pizzerias & Fast Casual Chains", desc: "Fast casual and pizza brands compete on speed of decision — someone hungry now wants the nearest, highest-rated option with visible pricing. We optimize local listings and run conversion-focused paid ads with clear offers, so you win the moment-of-decision search instead of losing it to a faster-loading competitor." },
      { icon: Sandwich, title: "Bakeries & Dessert Shops", desc: "Bakeries and dessert shops thrive on visually driven discovery — people scroll social feeds and search 'best cakes near me' well before an occasion. We build photo-led social content and local SEO tuned for occasion-based searches like birthdays and celebrations, keeping your shop top of mind when the craving or the occasion hits." },
      { icon: Users, title: "Restaurant Loyalty & Repeat-Visit Programs", desc: "Winning a first-time diner is only half the job; restaurants that grow sustainably turn first visits into repeat ones. We set up review-triggered follow-ups, social retargeting and loyalty-focused campaigns so guests who ate once are reminded to come back, building the repeat-visit base that drives steady revenue." },
      { icon: Award, title: "Restaurant Reputation & Review Management", desc: "A handful of bad reviews left unanswered can outweigh dozens of good meals in a diner's decision-making. We actively monitor and respond to reviews across Google, Zomato, TripAdvisor and social platforms, and build systems that prompt happy guests to leave reviews, keeping your public reputation an asset rather than a liability." },
    ],
